UPDATE public.stories SET title = 'Wait… so let me get this straight. We already spend more than anyone on defense — and not just a little more. I’m talking more than the next ten countries combined. And most of them? They’re our allies. But every year we get the same recycled excuses about how we “need” to increase the budget again — as if a trillion dollars just isn’t cutting it anymore. Meanwhile, schools are crumbling, hospitals are understaffed, and entire cities don’t even have clean water. But sure. Let’s pour even more into defense — for a war we’re not in, against people who aren’t coming. And what’s wild is if you even question it, you get told you “don’t understand how the world works.” Nah babe, I get it. I just don’t think we should be normalizing billion-dollar missiles while entire communities can’t afford insulin. This isn’t about safety. It’s about priorities. And once you start following the money… it gets real clear, real fast. This is part of my series Everything You Know Is a Lie. #frizzzz #everythingyouknowisalie #untoldhistory #americaneducation #capitalism #ushistory #tiktoklearningcampaign ' WHERE slug = 'tiktok-7528914909426502943';
