UPDATE public.stories SET title = '(1) Smart Fare Finder You’re a travel expert. Find me the cheapest flights from [CITY] to [DESTINATION] on [DATES]. Include nearby airports, alternative airlines, and flexible day options. (2) Flexible Date Optimizer I’m flying from [CITY] to [DESTINATION]. Show me the lowest fare across these 3 days: [LIST DATES]. Prioritize value over speed. (3) Free Upgrade Strategist I’m flying from [CITY] to [DESTINATION]. How can I score a free or discounted upgrade? Give me airport, timing, and loyalty-based hacks. (4) Hidden City Hacker Find me a cheaper ticket where [DESTINATION] is just the layover, but I’ll exit there instead. Include risks and how to avoid baggage issues. (5) Alternate Airport Finder Flights to [DESTINATION] are overpriced. What are the closest airport alternatives, and which have the lowest fares? (6) Last-Minute Steal Spotter Find me a last-minute flight to [DESTINATION] that’s 50% cheaper than standard fares. Include lesser-known deal sites or airlines. (7) Seasonal Price Tracker When’s the cheapest time to fly from [CITY] to [DESTINATION]? Show historical trends and the ideal booking window based on past 2 years. #prompts #chatgptprompts #ai #makemoneyonline #flightdiscounts #traveltiktok #travel ' WHERE slug = 'tiktok-7521956059511065887';
